1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Instructional records move through many hands.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Each week brings teaching loads, lesson plans, deadlines, and follow-ups.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:13,000
When these pieces are scattered, it takes longer to see what is complete,

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:17,000
what still needs attention, and where support is needed.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:22,000
CEDIMS brings the work into one shared view for Calapan East District.

6
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Teachers begin with their assigned subjects, upload documents, and see each status.

7
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:31,000
A calendar keeps upcoming weeks visible.

8
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:37,000
School leaders review progress across their school; district supervisors see five schools.

9
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:43,000
They can open the archive, follow a school folder, and examine trends.

10
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:49,000
The path from classroom record to district insight stays connected.

11
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Less searching, clearer follow-up, and more confident decisions.

12
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:00,000
CEDIMS. Clear records. Shared responsibility.
